{"title":"Easter Moai","slug":"Easter_Moai","hero":{"file":"Easterguybetter.webp","width":400,"height":400},"pageid":2700,"revid":21260,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:59:22Z","lastEditor":"Maxwell Games 3","categories":["Moai"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Hop 'N' Shop"},{"label":"Price","value":"🥚45"},{"label":"Function","value":"Decoration"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v.1.54.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"gallery","text":"Gallery"},{"id":"history","text":"History"}],"body":"<p><i><big>\"<b>Hippity Hoppity!</b>\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Easter Moai</b> is an item sold at the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hop_'N'_Shop/\">Hop 'N' Shop</a> for <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggs/\">🥚</a>45. It is one of the variations of the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Moai/\">Moai</a> and has only the purpose of decoration.\n</p><p>The <b>Easter moai</b> appears very small compared to the others, it looks a lot like a rabbit.\n</p><p>There was a brief time where the <b>Easter Moai's</b> in-game name was replaced with its in-game description, and the description being its in-code name.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"34362410ddcf687fbc8bf9be03ce826e\" data-seq-no=\"0\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Easter_moai-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Old location of the Easter moai\">Old location of the Easter moai</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Old location of the Easter moai\">Old location of the Easter moai</span></span></div></div><div>Old location of the <b>Easter moai</b></div></div></div>\n<h2 id=\"history\">History</h2>\n<ul><li>Was added in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Version_1.54.0/\">Version 1.54.0</a>, On the <span title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>;</li>\n<li>On the <span title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>, it was sold at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals/\">Eggcelent Deals</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2025_Easter_event/\">2025 Easter event</a>, the price has been changed from $8,089 to <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggs/\">🥚</a>45.</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2025_Easter_event/\">2025 Easter event</a>, it was sold at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals/\">Hop 'N' Shop</a>;</li></ul>"}
